WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:14.295
This is CreaBIM: one model of your building, and every drawing made from it. Slide a window along its wall in the plan, and the 3D follows.

2
00:00:15.495 --> 00:00:22.129
Arrange the window your way, from one big 3D view to plans and sheets side by side, in the theme you like.

3
00:00:23.329 --> 00:00:27.660
Select with a box, a circle or a lasso, and watch the count as you go.

4
00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:35.772
Then step into Edit mode, for points, edges and faces, the way you would in Blender.

5
00:00:38.879 --> 00:00:44.042
Keep a library of profiles, the presets and your own, for sweeps, beams and railings.

6
00:00:47.979 --> 00:00:52.609
Sheets, title blocks and schedules all come from the same model, ready to print.

7
00:01:00.629 --> 00:01:10.080
CreaBIM is free and open source, works offline, and speaks IFC. Some parts are still young: it's ready to explore, not yet for production.

8
00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:15.031
CreaBIM one point one. Download it free.
